WEBVTT

01:24.140 --> 01:29.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

01:54.710 --> 01:55.960
<i>It's cold.</i>

02:07.400 --> 02:09.680
<i>It's profoundly cold.</i>

02:11.900 --> 02:18.930
<i>But if I stay in bed like this,
 my precious day off will pass me by.</i>

02:33.970 --> 02:35.270
<i>It's time.</i>

02:40.760 --> 02:43.640
<b>Adorable baby pandas</b>

03:05.790 --> 03:08.790
Hey, hey! That was you at the store, right?

03:09.200 --> 03:11.180
Hey, hey! It's lunchtime!

03:11.180 --> 03:13.460
Wanna come with me to the cafeteria?

03:29.100 --> 03:30.730
<i>Oh, you finally answered—</i>

03:30.730 --> 03:32.200
You try my patience.

03:32.200 --> 03:36.770
Did you forget I told you not 
to call me on my day off, Rooney?

03:37.470 --> 03:40.740
<i>Of course I didn't, General!</i>

03:41.000 --> 03:44.170
Say, you're not showing up on my end.

03:44.170 --> 03:45.550
Wonder why. Is it busted?

03:45.550 --> 03:46.420
<i>Who knows?</i>

03:46.420 --> 03:48.480
Oh, I bet you're doing it on purpose.

03:48.950 --> 03:51.780
<i>This call ends in two seconds 
if it's about nothing.</i>

03:52.490 --> 03:53.770
Wait! Wait!

03:53.770 --> 03:56.750
I need to talk to you about an Earth monster!

03:56.750 --> 03:58.310
A monster?

03:59.440 --> 04:01.150
You've got five minutes.

04:01.150 --> 04:02.500
<i>Thank you!</i>

04:02.500 --> 04:07.580
So, I've been looking into some talk 
about a monster that appears in the winter

04:07.580 --> 04:10.020
and occupies human dwellings.

04:10.370 --> 04:12.430
Is it powerful?

04:12.860 --> 04:14.570
Very powerful.

04:15.450 --> 04:20.750
It uses warmth to lure in humans, 
then traps them in its belly.

04:21.110 --> 04:24.160
It eats humans, does it?

04:24.160 --> 04:26.930
That could work in our favor.

04:26.930 --> 04:31.120
<i>Yes. I was also wondering
 if we could use it somehow.</i>

04:31.120 --> 04:34.660
But... I let it get the better of me.

04:35.130 --> 04:36.130
It's already...

04:36.510 --> 04:39.410
<i>devoured me from the waist down.</i>

04:40.250 --> 04:42.240
Why didn't you say so sooner?!

04:42.240 --> 04:43.710
Where are you right now?!

04:44.000 --> 04:45.710
<i>The control room.</i>

04:46.490 --> 04:49.460
Headquarters has already been breached?!

04:50.020 --> 04:52.630
Give me a full report!

04:52.630 --> 04:55.160
<i>You're coming in, General?!</i>

04:55.160 --> 04:57.100
Of course I am!

04:57.100 --> 04:59.480
Try to hold out until I get there!

04:59.480 --> 05:02.340
<i>Oh, and hey! Could you buy 
some mandarin oranges?</i>

05:02.340 --> 05:03.380
Mandarin oranges?

05:04.030 --> 05:07.680
<i>Apparently, that's what you 
do with this monster.</i>

05:07.680 --> 05:12.070
<i>Yet I completely forgot to prepare some.</i>

05:12.070 --> 05:15.270
So you distract the enemy 
with its favorite food?

05:15.270 --> 05:17.660
How could you forget to prepare a decoy?

05:17.660 --> 05:19.390
But rejoice!

05:19.500 --> 05:22.880
<b>Yumeiro Mandarin Oranges</b>

05:19.710 --> 05:22.610
I just bought a bunch of oranges yesterday!

05:23.630 --> 05:27.040
We always go through 
mandarin oranges in no time,

05:27.040 --> 05:28.660
so I buy them by the box.

05:28.660 --> 05:29.730
Makes sense.

05:30.850 --> 05:32.840
<i>Rooney isn't combat personnel.</i>

05:32.840 --> 05:34.840
<i>He stands no chance in an attack!</i>

05:34.840 --> 05:35.730
<i>Damn you!</i>

05:36.650 --> 05:38.780
<i>Damn you, Earthlings!</i>

05:45.910 --> 05:47.470
Rooney!

05:53.960 --> 05:57.050
General! I'm so glad you've come!

05:57.050 --> 06:01.080
Teach me how to free myself 
from this wintertime monster!

06:03.580 --> 06:07.590
I'll get cold if I get up, but I've needed 
to go to the bathroom for ages now!

06:07.590 --> 06:11.060
What do I do, General?!

06:13.580 --> 06:18.450
You're well-versed in human culture, 
so you must know a way.

06:18.450 --> 06:22.960
Oh? You know, I haven't seen you 
with your hair down in forever.

06:23.730 --> 06:25.900
KONK

06:23.870 --> 06:25.080
Ouch!

06:32.410 --> 06:36.120
Behold the winter monster's final form!

06:36.120 --> 06:38.830
Less talking, more peeling.

06:39.960 --> 06:45.960
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

06:39.960 --> 06:45.960
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

07:06.080 --> 07:07.490
Look!

07:07.800 --> 07:09.530
It's so cute!

07:08.780 --> 07:10.490
warm

07:09.550 --> 07:10.490
warm

07:10.480 --> 07:11.930
It's a panda.

07:11.930 --> 07:14.740
Yeah, a limited-edition panda bun!

07:14.740 --> 07:16.160
<i>Panda bun?!</i>

07:16.580 --> 07:19.080
That convenience store back there had them.

07:19.360 --> 07:22.040
<i>You can get them at convenience stores?</i>

07:22.040 --> 07:23.260
What's the filling?

07:23.260 --> 07:24.330
Probably meat.

07:24.330 --> 07:27.960
We just ate, and now 
you're going to have more?

07:27.960 --> 07:30.850
What can you do? 'Tis the 
season for Chinese buns!

07:30.850 --> 07:33.940
But I also don't want to overdo it.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.650
Let's go halfsies.

07:39.650 --> 07:41.810
Jeez, why'd you buy one <i>now</i>?

07:41.810 --> 07:43.100
But thanks.

07:43.420 --> 07:44.840
Hey, that's tasty.

07:44.840 --> 07:46.100
Right?

07:55.220 --> 07:57.010
Welcome!

07:57.370 --> 07:59.370
<b>Manager Recommended</b>

07:57.370 --> 07:59.370
<b>Hot Snacks</b>

07:57.370 --> 07:59.370
<b>Freshly brewed coffee</b>

07:59.390 --> 08:01.230
<b>Chocolate!!</b>

07:59.390 --> 08:01.230
<b>Half Off</b>

08:28.670 --> 08:30.520
Have you decided?

08:30.750 --> 08:34.800
We have those limited-edition 
panda buns all this month.

08:34.800 --> 08:38.940
They're packed full of meat, 
and they're juicier than the regular ones!

08:38.940 --> 08:40.270
I recommend them!

08:40.290 --> 08:50.000
<b>This month's recommendation</b>

08:40.520 --> 08:44.190
But they're so cute,
 it's kind of a shame to eat them.

08:44.190 --> 08:47.980
I feel a little bad doing it, you know?

08:50.010 --> 08:52.400
<i>There I go again!</i>

08:52.400 --> 08:53.420
I'm sorry!

08:53.420 --> 08:54.090
You.

08:54.090 --> 08:55.020
Yes, sir!

08:56.250 --> 08:58.390
You get it.

08:58.390 --> 08:59.270
Uh?

09:03.260 --> 09:06.480
I'll have to build up to it.

09:06.480 --> 09:08.360
Oh, sure...

09:09.270 --> 09:12.280
<b>A later date</b>

09:09.950 --> 09:11.770
Welcome!

09:24.970 --> 09:27.340
I recommend these, too.

09:27.580 --> 09:30.090
<b>Original Meat Buns</b>

09:36.610 --> 09:41.600
<b>You'll find convenient ready-made food at the checkout counter!</b>

09:37.330 --> 09:39.530
Thank you so much!

09:46.670 --> 09:48.580
<i>To start, a meat bun.</i>

09:50.620 --> 09:52.210
Sure is small.

09:56.360 --> 09:58.860
<b>The next day</b>

09:59.590 --> 10:01.480
<i>Today, a pizza bun.</i>

10:01.870 --> 10:04.370
<b>The day after</b>

10:04.370 --> 10:06.060
<i>Today, a sweet bean paste bun.</i>

10:04.370 --> 10:07.870
<b>anxious</b>

10:05.140 --> 10:07.870
<b>anxious</b>

10:05.890 --> 10:07.870
<b>anxious</b>

10:06.060 --> 10:07.510
Thanks for waiting.

10:06.640 --> 10:07.870
<b>anxious</b>

10:07.870 --> 10:10.380
<b>Several
days later</b>

10:10.370 --> 10:13.070
<i>Today, a gourmet pork bun.</i>

10:10.380 --> 10:17.380
<b>anxious</b>

10:10.380 --> 10:17.380
<b>anxious</b>

10:10.900 --> 10:17.380
<b>anxious</b>

10:11.650 --> 10:17.380
<b>anxious</b>

10:13.070 --> 10:15.540
<i>This has become my after-work treat.</i>

10:15.540 --> 10:16.440
Here you go.

10:17.380 --> 10:20.390
<b>Several more
days later</b>

10:21.150 --> 10:22.380
Welcome.

10:32.560 --> 10:34.350
<i>Today's the day.</i>

10:34.820 --> 10:38.320
<b>Pork Chunk Buns</b>

10:43.360 --> 10:45.110
Thanks!

10:50.910 --> 10:57.330
<i>By the time I worked up the nerve, 
they'd discontinued the panda buns.</i>

11:07.180 --> 11:17.220
<i>I'm a high-ranking officer of the Evil League,
which fights daily to wipe out humankind</i>

11:17.220 --> 11:20.410
<i>and claim the Earth in the 
name of our home planet.</i>

11:20.780 --> 11:23.240
<i>But today is my day off.</i>

11:23.730 --> 11:27.160
<i>I stopped by the supermarket 
on my way home from the zoo.</i>

11:28.750 --> 11:30.750
<b>Meat Buns</b>

11:28.750 --> 11:30.750
<b>Meat Buns</b>

11:30.740 --> 11:32.620
<i>Chinese buns?!</i>

11:32.620 --> 11:35.060
<i>Somewhere other than the convenience store?</i>

11:35.060 --> 11:37.020
<i>And in four-packs?</i>

11:36.000 --> 11:38.070
I wonder what I should fix tonight.

11:37.020 --> 11:38.720
<i>What a bargain!</i>

11:38.070 --> 11:41.180
Well, how about something warm?

11:38.720 --> 11:41.480
<i>I know what </i>I'm<i> having 
for breakfast tomorrow.</i>

11:41.180 --> 11:42.240
Good idea!

11:42.240 --> 11:43.120
Yeah!

11:52.270 --> 11:53.640
Chinese bun...

11:55.350 --> 11:56.840
Chinese bun...

11:57.970 --> 11:59.450
Chinese bun...

11:59.770 --> 12:01.190
Chinese bun...

12:01.490 --> 12:02.570
Chinese—

12:06.630 --> 12:08.280
Dampen it.

12:10.030 --> 12:11.360
Wrap it up.

12:12.280 --> 12:14.620
One minute in the microwave.

12:32.810 --> 12:34.810
<b>flat...</b>

12:42.980 --> 12:45.850
<i>At least it </i>tasted<i> like a Chinese bun.</i>

12:47.120 --> 12:50.120
<b>Meanwhile</b>

12:50.120 --> 12:52.040
<b>flat...</b>

12:54.580 --> 12:55.720
My meat bun...

12:56.410 --> 12:57.740
How could this be?

12:58.340 --> 13:01.550
Red, you wrapped it too tightly.

13:01.550 --> 13:04.920
When you do that, 
it forms a vacuum that flattens it.

13:04.920 --> 13:06.960
I feel sorry for the meat bun.

13:07.220 --> 13:13.970
I'm sure even it wanted to be eaten 
in its original fluffy form.

13:13.970 --> 13:16.480
And now it's been reduced to this.

13:17.340 --> 13:18.830
Poor thing.

13:20.040 --> 13:22.330
Sorry, meat bun!

13:22.330 --> 13:24.040
This is all my fault!

13:24.630 --> 13:27.650
What a fuss to make over a single meat bun.

13:27.650 --> 13:30.000
And stop picking on Red.

13:30.680 --> 13:33.490
If you two want meat buns, 
I'll warm them up for you.

13:33.770 --> 13:36.740
No thanks, Blue. They come out 
all hard when you do them.

13:36.740 --> 13:38.880
You both suck at this.

13:38.880 --> 13:40.870
Gimme a break!

13:41.230 --> 13:44.040
Actually, we have this amazing thing.

13:44.040 --> 13:48.440
We always use this to get fluffy meat buns.

13:48.440 --> 13:49.930
You should've said so!

13:57.240 --> 14:00.330
To think such a superb device exists...

14:00.330 --> 14:01.780
It's so fluffy.

14:02.980 --> 14:08.990
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

14:02.980 --> 14:08.990
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

14:19.780 --> 14:21.450
Hooray!

16:18.330 --> 16:20.860
<i>Today's a compensatory day off,</i>

16:20.860 --> 16:25.080
<i>and I'm on my way to the zoo 
for some soothing panda time.</i>

16:45.930 --> 16:47.030
Hey.

16:48.570 --> 16:49.730
Let me help.

16:52.230 --> 16:55.750
Well, well. I do appreciate it.

17:11.510 --> 17:12.360
Hey.

17:16.280 --> 17:17.770
Climb on.

17:19.130 --> 17:22.020
Well, thanks a bunch!

17:22.950 --> 17:25.910
You got a good grip, old man?

17:25.910 --> 17:26.980
Sure do.

17:27.670 --> 17:28.700
Okay.

17:37.240 --> 17:40.410
You're such a kind boy, sonny.

17:40.650 --> 17:41.980
"Sonny"?

17:42.360 --> 17:44.880
Would you lend me a hand again?

17:44.880 --> 17:46.810
Fine by me.

17:46.810 --> 17:48.430
Good, good.

17:49.680 --> 17:52.540
You're a good boy. Thank you.

18:08.540 --> 18:11.050
<i>Did he mistake me for his 
grandson or something?</i>

18:14.110 --> 18:18.340
<i>Humans are so fleeting, it's painful.</i>

18:23.030 --> 18:26.130
<i>Three hundred and fifty-three pandas...</i>

18:26.130 --> 18:29.390
<i>Three hundred and fifty-four pandas...</i>

18:29.390 --> 18:32.490
<i>Three hundred and fifty-five pandas...</i>

18:32.850 --> 18:36.410
<i>Three hundred and fifty-six pandas...</i>

18:36.860 --> 18:40.090
<i>Three hundred and fifty-seven pandas...</i>

18:40.090 --> 18:43.370
<i>Three hundred and fifty-eight pandas...</i>

18:44.350 --> 18:46.770
<i>Three hundred and fifty-nine...</i>

19:07.020 --> 19:09.060
Where am I?

19:09.060 --> 19:11.210
Sonny! Sonny!

19:11.500 --> 19:15.960
Am I glad to see you!
Lend me a hand again, won't you?

19:16.350 --> 19:17.950
You're the old man from today...

19:17.950 --> 19:19.920
Here, put this on. It's cold.

19:21.900 --> 19:23.590
Okay, now come with me.

19:23.590 --> 19:24.270
Wai—

19:24.990 --> 19:26.320
This way!

19:53.080 --> 19:56.780
Old man, do you always do this hard labor?

19:57.330 --> 19:59.310
Yup, I sure do.

19:59.690 --> 20:02.320
Haven't you reached retirement age?

20:03.640 --> 20:09.620
I'd like to keep it up, as long as 
there are children who believe in me.

20:12.890 --> 20:18.400
Even if I'm a fairy tale 
they naturally forget as they grow up,

20:18.400 --> 20:25.680
I'm alive in their hearts for as 
long as they believe I exist.

20:31.410 --> 20:36.350
I want to grant their little 
wishes, one by one.

20:37.000 --> 20:38.080
Old man...

20:38.670 --> 20:43.920
And sometimes, I get to meet 
kind young ones like yourself.

20:44.760 --> 20:49.000
Thank you for today, 
child of a distant star.

20:50.200 --> 20:52.320
Merry Christmas to you.

21:06.470 --> 21:10.960
I think I had a dream about 
doing hard labor in the snow...

21:10.960 --> 21:13.480
Oddly enough, my muscles feel sore.

21:23.290 --> 21:25.360
Might as well put away the bedding.

21:28.220 --> 21:29.670
<i>Good morning!</i>

21:29.670 --> 21:31.930
<i>Today is December 25th.</i>

21:31.930 --> 21:33.090
<i>That means it's Christmas.</i>

21:34.080 --> 21:36.590
<i>Christmas songs are playing downtown,</i>

21:36.590 --> 21:41.070
<i>there are lights everywhere, and I suspect 
plenty of people are out and about.</i>

21:41.680 --> 21:45.590
<i>I hope all of you have a wonderful day.</i>

23:20.040 --> 23:20.830
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

23:20.040 --> 23:20.830
<b>MR. VILLAIN'S DAY OFF</b>

23:22.370 --> 23:27.170
Milky clouds hanging
 in the jet-black sky...

23:27.170 --> 23:29.690
Before you know it, they change shape...

23:30.090 --> 23:33.890
and twinkle gently in the light.

23:34.960 --> 23:41.220
At a brief, quiet gathering, 
the wind blows and flowers scatter.

23:43.090 --> 23:47.860
A lost child, when spring comes to town.

23:48.360 --> 23:49.980
<b>When Spring Comes to Town</b>
